<title>HUNGARY: CESI index firms, ends at 1,439.37 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index firms, ends at 1,439.37 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index gained 10.95 points or 0.77 percent to end at 1,439.38 points on Wednesday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungrian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
